{"seq":36,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28512"},"reason":"New question on the Aten, history's famous experiment in a single sun god, which the article mentioned but did not ask about; verified on Wikipedia's Aten article (sole god of the state religion under Amenhotep IV, who renamed himself Akhenaten; Amarna period c. 1353–1336 BCE; the cult did not persist beyond his death).","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aten"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"Aten"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"Aton"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"Атон"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[949,4],"de":[1046,4],"ru":[902,4]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"reign","start":"-1353","end":"-1336","precision":"year","approx":true,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"Reign of Akhenaten, who makes the Aten Egypt's sole state god (Amarna period)","labelDe":"Herrschaft Echnatons, der Aton zum einzigen Staatsgott Ägyptens macht (Amarnazeit)","labelRu":"Правление Эхнатона, сделавшего Атона единственным государственным богом Египта (амарнский период)"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aten","title":"Aten – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"e7b6453d40ec"},
